			"notes": "- Rewrote the entire mod to serve more as a library for the sake of other mods.\n- The mod is now open source.\n- Removed \"weatherAPIKey\" from the config, as an api key is no longer required at all.\n- Command blocks can no longer run /weatherwatch commands, I forsaw lag machines being made with forceResync so I shut that shit down.\n- (hopefully) Improved accuaracy with time sync (it would sometimes be a second or two off).\n- Overall performance improvements."
